  "thag1.9:0.4": "9. Pilindavacchattheragāthā 9. ",
  "thag1.9:1.1": "‘‘Svāgataṃ na durāgataṃ , ",
  "thag1.9:1.2": "nayidaṃ dumantitaṃ mama; ",
  "thag1.9:1.3": "Saṃvibhattesu dhammesu, ",
  "thag1.9:1.4": "yaṃ seṭṭhaṃ tadupāgami’’nti. ",
  "thag1.9:1.5": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pilindavaccho thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthāti. "
}
